--------------------------------------------------
GITLAB BRANCH REQUEST / MERGE REQUEST
--------------------------------------------------

Branch Request:

Create a branch in GitLab or push your local branch to GitLab.

git push -u origin GitNewBranch


Merge Request:

1. Push the branch to GitLab.
2. Open the GitLab project.
3. Select Merge Requests.
4. Create a New Merge Request.
5. Select:
   Source branch → GitNewBranch
   Target branch → master
6. Add title/description.
7. Create the Merge Request.
8. Review the changes.
9. Merge the request into master.


KEY POINT:

Branch = Separate line of development.

Merge = Combine changes from one branch into another.

Master = Main branch used as the target in this lab.
